{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-34781","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37179","text":"Agentelic Documentation"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-34783","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37180","marks":["bold"],"text":"Build agents like software. Spec-driven. Tested. Deployed."}]}],"id":"blk-34782","kind":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-34785","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37181","marks":["bold"],"text":"Part of the [&] Protocol stack"},{"id":"spn-37182","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-37183","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/ECOSYSTEM.md"}],"text":"Ecosystem overview"},{"id":"spn-37184","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-37185","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/PULSE/docs/THREE_PROTOCOL_STACK.md"}],"text":"Three-protocol stack"},{"id":"spn-37186","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-37187","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/STACK_COMPLETION.md"}],"text":"Stack status"}]}],"id":"blk-34784","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-34786","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37188","text":"Welcome to the documentation hub for "},{"id":"spn-37189","marks":["bold"],"text":"Agentelic"},{"id":"spn-37190","text":" — a premium, enterprise-grade agent builder that brings software engineering discipline to AI agent development."}]},{"id":"blk-34787","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37191","text":"Agentelic targets the engineering teams that need to ship reliable agents to production — with versioned specs, deterministic testing, staged rollouts, and compliance gates. While the market is flooded with no-code agent builders optimized for demos, Agentelic is optimized for production."}]},{"id":"blk-34788","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37192","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-34789","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37193","text":"What Agentelic Does"}]},{"id":"blk-34790","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37194","text":"Agentelic is the "},{"id":"spn-37195","marks":["bold"],"text":"engineering layer"},{"id":"spn-37196","text":" of the [&] Protocol ecosystem:"}]},{"id":"blk-34791","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"SpecPrompt (Standards)    → defines agent behavior as versioned specs\n    ↓\nAgentelic (Engineering)   → builds, tests, deploys agents against specs  ← THIS\n    ↓\nOpenSentience (Runtime)   → governs, executes, observes agents locally\n    ↓\nGraphonomous (Memory)     → continual learning knowledge graphs\n    ↓\nFleetPrompt (Distribution) · Delegatic (Orchestration)"},{"id":"blk-34792","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37197","marks":["bold"],"text":"Key capabilities:"}]},{"id":"blk-34793","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-34795","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37198","marks":["bold"],"text":"Spec-driven builds"},{"id":"spn-37199","text":" — Every agent starts from a SpecPrompt specification."}]}],"id":"blk-34794","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-34796","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37200","text":"Parse, generate, compile, and package in one pipeline."}]},{"id":"blk-34797","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-34799","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37201","marks":["bold"],"text":"Deterministic testing"},{"id":"spn-37202","text":" — Tests are derived from acceptance criteria, not"}]}],"id":"blk-34798","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-34800","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37203","text":"hand-written. Mocked tool calls, output validation, regression suites."}]},{"id":"blk-34801","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-34803","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37204","marks":["bold"],"text":"Staged deployment"},{"id":"spn-37205","text":" — Staging → canary → production with permission review"}]}],"id":"blk-34802","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-34804","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37206","text":"gates and compliance checks."}]},{"id":"blk-34805","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-34807","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37207","marks":["bold"],"text":"MCP tool surface"},{"id":"spn-37208","text":" — The entire build pipeline is exposed as MCP tools for"}]}],"id":"blk-34806","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-34808","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37209","text":"AI-assisted agent development."}]},{"id":"blk-34809","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-37210","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-34810","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-37211","text":"Documentation Map"}]},{"id":"blk-34811","kind":"code","language":"text","text":":maxdepth: 1\n:caption: Homepages\n\n[&] Ampersand Box <https://ampersandboxdesign.com>\nGraphonomous <https://graphonomous.com>\nBendScript <https://bendscript.com>\nWebHost.Systems <https://webhost.systems>\nAgentelic <https://agentelic.com>\nAgenTroMatic <https://agentromatic.com>\nDelegatic <https://delegatic.com>\nDeliberatic <https://deliberatic.com>\nFleetPrompt <https://fleetprompt.com>\nGeoFleetic <https://geofleetic.com>\nOpenSentience <https://opensentience.org>\nSpecPrompt <https://specprompt.com>\nTickTickClock <https://ticktickclock.com>"},{"id":"blk-34812","kind":"code","language":"text","text":":maxdepth: 1\n:caption: Root Docs\n\n[&] Protocol Docs <https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com>\nGraphonomous Docs <https://docs.graphonomous.com>\nBendScript Docs <https://docs.bendscript.com>\nWebHost.Systems Docs <https://docs.webhost.systems>\nAgentelic Docs <https://docs.agentelic.com>\nAgenTroMatic Docs <https://docs.agentromatic.com>\nDelegatic Docs <https://docs.delegatic.com>\nDeliberatic Docs <https://docs.deliberatic.com>\nFleetPrompt Docs <https://docs.fleetprompt.com>\nGeoFleetic Docs <https://docs.geofleetic.com>\nOpenSentience Docs <https://docs.opensentience.org>\nSpecPrompt Docs <https://docs.specprompt.com>\nTickTickClock Docs <https://docs.ticktickclock.com>"},{"id":"blk-34813","kind":"code","language":"text","text":":maxdepth: 2\n:caption: Agentelic Docs\n\nspec/README"},{"id":"blk-34814","kind":"paragraph","s